# Purpose     : Unicode general category classes for the
#               pre-tokenizer, as sorted runs with an ASCII table.
# Stage       : Pipeline stage 2 of 4, see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
# Depends on  : Nothing. Constants and pure lookups only.
# Invariants  : Runs are sorted, non overlapping, and never carry
#               the OTHER class, so binary search is well defined.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generator   : scripts/gen_unicode_tables.py
# Upstream    : Unicode Character Database 15.0.0, via Python unicodedata
